<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-BRITISH LIONS BEAT EMERGING SPRINGBOKS 51-22.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BRITISH LIONS BEAT EMERGING SPRINGBOKS 51-22.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON, South Africa 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The British Lions beat the Emerging Springboks 51-22 (halftime 16-15) in their rugby union tour match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Emerging Springboks - Tries: Warren Brosnihan, Marius Goosen, Paul Treu. Conversions: M.J. Smith, Percival Montgomery. Penalty: M.J. Smith.</p>
<p>British Lions - Tries: Nick Beal (3), Graham Rowntree, Tim Stimpson, Mike Catt. Conversions: Stimpson (6). Penalties: Stimpson (3).</p>
</text>
